OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRain in far west initially,
OL,6,Fwith patchy outbreaks affecting the
OL,7,Frest of the region during morning,
OL,8,Fthen turning more persistent in
OL,9,FArgyll, perhaps also in Glasgow, late
OL,10,Fafternoon. Southerly winds
OL,11,Fstrengthening across the coasts and
OL,12,FIsles for the afternoon.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FPersistent rain for the
OL,15,Fevening, turning heavier at times,
OL,16,Fbefore clearing overnight, to leave
OL,17,Fonly a few scattered showers come
OL,18,Fdawn, these mainly across Argyll.
OL,19,FBrisk southerly winds easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
