OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA day of showers mixed with
OL,6,Fbrighter spells, with outbreaks
OL,7,Ffrequent across Argyll, occasional
OL,8,Faround Glasgow and isolated to the
OL,9,Fsouth and east.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,12,FSaturday brings brighter spells and
OL,13,Fscattered showers. Sunday sees showers
OL,14,For longer periods of rain and brisk
OL,15,Fsouth to southwest winds. Monday
OL,16,Fmainly dry with brighter spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
